-q-o032","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ab07dc24c0c9b1f10809","layer":"original","quote":"二十二年春〖3〗，权令都尉徐详，诣曹公请降；公报使修好，誓重结婚。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o061","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-de047b32de569664b9fa","layer":"original","quote":"肃年四十六，建安二十二年卒。权为举哀〖17〗，又临其葬〖18〗。诸葛亮亦为发哀。﹝二﹞","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
